# Mom, the Adventurer? (bastok 21): Nbu Latteh and Parnika in Bastok Markets, Roh Latteh in Bastok Mines. The offer 230
# (no guard) with a full inventory (no Fire Crystal: not begun), then begun; accepted: Nbu's 231, Parnika's 232, Roh's
# trades (a bone chip: nil; a Copper Ring: 95, the ring taken, the Letter from Roh Latteh; another ring with the
# letter: nil); Nbu's 233 (the letter not seen: completed, fame +10, Ringbearer, 200 gil, the letter deleted, the
# mustZone set). Completed with the mustZone set: no section (Nbu's default 127); out and back: the repeat at fame
# level 1 (Prog 0): Roh's ring trade at Prog 0 (nil), 230 with a full inventory (Prog stays 0), 230 (Prog 1), 231,
# Parnika's 232, Roh's 95, the letter seen, Nbu's 234 (completed again: 100 gil).
# The Signpost Marks the Spot (C#) also names Nbu and Roh: it needs Bastok fame level 2, and the char stays at fame 0.
# Defaults: Nbu 127, Parnika 136, Roh 29.
lists BastokMarkets/Nbu_Latteh/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Nbu_Latteh/onTrade BastokMarkets/Parnika/onTrigger BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/230 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/233 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/234 BastokMines/Roh_Latteh/onTrade BastokMines/onEventFinish/95
char zone=BastokMines pos=-11.8,7,-9.2 lvl=10
item BoneChip
item CopperRing
item CopperRing
item CopperRing
login
trade Roh_Latteh CopperRing x1 # available: no handler (section 1 has none at Roh): nothing, the ring kept
warp -114.8,-4,-112.3 BastokMarkets
trade Nbu_Latteh BoneChip x1   # no trade handler: nothing
trigger Parnika                # available: no handler, 136
finish
trigger Nbu_Latteh             # available: 230
fill-inventory
finish                         # the crystal does not fit: not begun
free-inventory
trigger Nbu_Latteh             # 230 again
finish                         # a Fire Crystal, begun
trigger Nbu_Latteh             # no letter: 231
finish
trigger Parnika                # accepted: 232
finish
warp -11.8,7,-9.2 BastokMines
trade Roh_Latteh BoneChip x1   # not a ring: nil, nothing
trade Roh_Latteh CopperRing x1 # no letter: 95
finish                         # the ring taken, the Letter from Roh Latteh
trade Roh_Latteh CopperRing x1 # the letter held: nil
warp -114.8,-4,-112.3 BastokMarkets
trigger Nbu_Latteh             # the letter, not seen: 233
finish                         # completed: fame +10, Ringbearer, the letter deleted, 200 gil, mustZone set
trigger Nbu_Latteh             # completed, mustZone set: no section, 127
finish
zoneline BastokMines           # mustZone cleared
walk -11.8,7,-9.2              # trade does not walk
trade Roh_Latteh CopperRing x1 # completed, Prog 0: nil
zoneline BastokMarkets
trigger Nbu_Latteh             # completed, fame level 1, Prog 0: 230 (the repeat)
fill-inventory
finish                         # the crystal does not fit: Prog stays 0
free-inventory
trigger Nbu_Latteh             # 230 again
finish                         # a Fire Crystal, Prog 1
trigger Nbu_Latteh             # Prog 1: 231
finish
trigger Parnika                # completed: 232
finish
warp -11.8,7,-9.2 BastokMines
trade Roh_Latteh BoneChip x1   # completed, Prog 1, no letter, not a ring: nil
trade Roh_Latteh CopperRing x1 # Prog 1, no letter: 95
finish                         # the letter
trade Roh_Latteh CopperRing x1 # completed, Prog 1, the letter held: nil
seekeyitem LetterFromRohLatteh
warp -114.8,-4,-112.3 BastokMarkets
trigger Nbu_Latteh             # the letter seen: 234
finish                         # completed again: fame +10, the letter deleted, 100 gil, mustZone set
